# The console keeps what scrolled off the top: its window gets a scroll bar
# (1834..1844 from y=104 at 1920x1080), the thumb at the bottom; Shift+Page
# Up looks a page back (the thumb leaves the bottom), new text comes back.
@ai
$ ai control on
$ help
$ help
@screenshot 1920x1080 pixels 1839,985=8a9bb0
@ctl keys {machine} "{shift+pageup}"
# (no command typed here: new text in the console brings the live view back)
@screenshot 1920x1080 pixels 1839,985=2b3a55
@ctl keys {machine} "{shift+pagedown}"
@screenshot 1920x1080 pixels 1839,985=8a9bb0
